"Haññate nūna manojo, ", "ja397:1.4": "migarājā sakhā mama. ", "ja397:2.1": "Handa dāni vanantāni, ", "ja397:2.2": "pakkamāmi yathāsukhaṁ; ", "ja397:2.3": "Netādisā sakhā honti, ", "ja397:2.4": "labbhā me jīvato sakhā”. ", "ja397:3.1": "“Na pāpajanasaṁsevī, ", "ja397:3.2": "accantaṁ sukhamedhati; ", "ja397:3.3": "Manojaṁ passa semānaṁ, ", "ja397:3.4": "giriyassānusāsanī”. ", "ja397:4.1": "“Na pāpasampavaṅkena, ", "ja397:4.2": "mātā puttena nandati; ", "ja397:4.3": "Manojaṁ passa semānaṁ, ", "ja397:4.4": "acchannaṁ samhi lohite”. ", "ja397:5.1": "“Evamāpajjate poso, ", "ja397:5.2": "pāpiyo ca nigacchati; ", "ja397:5.3": "Yo ve hitānaṁ vacanaṁ, ", "ja397:5.4": "na karoti atthadassinaṁ”. ", "ja397:6.1": "“Evañca so hoti tato ca pāpiyo, ", "ja397:6.2": "Yo uttamo adhamajanūpasevī; ", "ja397:6.3": "Passuttamaṁ adhamajanūpasevitaṁ, ", "ja397:6.4": "Migādhipaṁ saravaraveganiddhutaṁ”. ", "ja397:7.1": "“Nihīyati puriso nihīnasevī, ", "ja397:7.2": "Na ca hāyetha kadāci tulyasevī; ", "ja397:7.3": "Seṭṭhamupagamaṁ udeti khippaṁ, ", "ja397:7.4": "Tasmāttanā uttaritaraṁ bhajethā”ti. ", "ja397:8.1": "Manojajātakaṁ dutiyaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja397:0.1": "", "ja397:0.2": "", "ja397:0.3": "", "ja397:0.4": "", "ja397:1.1": "", "ja397:1.2": "", "ja397:1.3": "", "ja397:1.4": "", "ja397:2.1": "", "ja397:2.2": "", "ja397:2.3": "", "ja397:2.4": "", "ja397:3.1": "", "ja397:3.2": "", "ja397:3.3": "", "ja397:3.4": "giriyassānusāsanī → ariyassānusāsanī (mr) ", "ja397:4.1": "", "ja397:4.2": "", "ja397:4.3": "", "ja397:4.4": "acchannaṁ → sacchannaṁ (mr) ", "ja397:5.1": "", "ja397:5.2": "", "ja397:5.3": "", "ja397:5.4": "", "ja397:6.1": "", "ja397:6.2": "", "ja397:6.3": "adhamajanūpasevitaṁ → … seviṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja397:6.4": "", "ja397:7.1": "", "ja397:7.2": "", "ja397:7.3": "Seṭṭhamupagamaṁ → … mupanamaṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1 an3.26:1 [26. Sevitabbasutta]); … mupagamañca (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja397:7.4": "Tasmāttanā uttaritaraṁ → tasmā attano uttariṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1); tasmā attano uttaraṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja397:8.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja397:0.1": "", "ja397:0.2": "", "ja397:0.3": "", "ja397:0.4": "", "ja397:1.1": "bj30.266, ms22J_1493, msdiv8, pts-vp-pli3.323", "ja397:1.2": "", "ja397:1.3": "", "ja397:1.4": "", "ja397:2.1": "ms22J_1494, msdiv9", "ja397:2.2": "", "ja397:2.3": "", "ja397:2.4": "", "ja397:3.1": "dr27.212, ms22J_1495, msdiv10, sya27.213, vri68.130", "ja397:3.2": "", "ja397:3.3": "", "ja397:3.4": "", "ja397:4.1": "ms22J_1496, msdiv11", "ja397:4.2": "", "ja397:4.3": "", "ja397:4.4": "", "ja397:5.1": "ms22J_1497, msdiv12", "ja397:5.2": "", "ja397:5.3": "", "ja397:5.4": "", "ja397:6.1": "ms22J_1498, msdiv13, ndp22.148, pts-vp-pli3.324", "ja397:6.2": "", "ja397:6.3": "", "ja397:6.4": "", "ja397:7.1": "csp1ed22.157, csp2ed22.157, ms22J_1499, msdiv14", "ja397:7.2": "", "ja397:7.3": "", "ja397:7.4": "", "ja397:8.1": "ms22J_1500"}, "keys_order": ["ja397:0.1", "ja397:0.2", "ja397:0.3", "ja397:0.4", "ja397:1.1", "ja397:1.2", "ja397:1.3", "ja397:1.4", "ja397:2.1", "ja397:2.2", "ja397:2.3", "ja397:2.4", "ja397:3.1", "ja397:3.2", "ja397:3.3", "ja397:3.4", "ja397:4.1", "ja397:4.2", "ja397:4.3", "ja397:4.4", "ja397:5.1", "ja397:5.2", "ja397:5.3", "ja397:5.4", "ja397:6.1", "ja397:6.2", "ja397:6.3", "ja397:6.4", "ja397:7.1", "ja397:7.2", "ja397:7.3", "ja397:7.4", "ja397:8.1"]}